    <!--
      Vocabulary.

      One noun per concept, and every screen draws its wording from here so the three
      words for the same thing ("event", "budget", "plan") cannot come back:

        budget      the thing the user creates - a wedding, or a salary month
        total       the amount of money that budget has
        category    one line of the breakdown, with a planned amount and an actual spend

      "Event" survives only inside the code (EventEntity, eventId); nothing the user
      reads says it.
    -->
