    <!--
      The savings-goal vocabulary.

      A savings goal runs the same arithmetic backwards: the total is a target, the
      categories are where the money will come from, and every entry brings the
      remaining figure down because the goal is getting closer. The maths was always
      right; the words were not. An app that asks somebody to "record a spending item"
      to log their monthly contribution has told them it does not understand what they
      are doing.

      Every string here is the SAVING half of a pair whose SPENDING half is above, and
      the two are chosen between in one place — see BudgetWords.
    -->
